/**
 * Novel overview panel — renders the story beat graph (React Flow) as the
 * primary view, with a side panel for beat details and actions.
 *
 * The graph is the authoritative story plan; beats light up as chapters are
 * written. The graph itself is generated by an AI agent — the user clicks
 * "生成故事图" to open a conversation session with a structured prompt.
 * Selecting a beat offers "推演" and "撰写" actions that also open sessions
 * with beat-specific context.
 */
